{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788269162-ikfBmi8mN3j8qBy0xrX5","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now `.withBindMount` is not a function on the result of `withEndpoint(...)` — because `withEndpoint` returns a **Promise**, and `.withBindMount` is called on the Promise (the chain is `addContainer(...).withEndpoint(...).withBindMount(...)` all synchronous!). Look at generated code:\n\n```js\nconst cache_0 = await builder.addContainer(\"redis\", ...)\n    .withEndpoint({...})\n    .withBindMount(...);\n```\n\nSo `addContainer()` returns chainable, `.withEndpoint()` returns **chainable** (not a promise!), `.withBindMount()` returns **Promise** (since await binds there). So all chain methods return the chainable object synchronously; the LAST one returns the promise... or every method returns the chainable itself and the whole expression is awaited (await on a non-promise value is fine — `await r` where r is not a thenable just resolves to r!).\n\nSimplest: make every chain method return `r` itself (synchronously, non-thenable). Then `await` unwraps non-thenables harmlessly. But `getEndpoint` and `withHealthCheck` are awaited individually: `await cache_0.getEndpoint('tcp')` — if getEndpoint returns `r` (non-thenable), await gives r, then `.property(...)` is called on r — r has no `property`! The generated code does:\n\n```js\nconst cache_0_tcpEndpoint = await cache_0.getEndpoint('tcp');\nconst cache_0_hostPort = cache_0_tcpEndpoint.property(EndpointProperty.HostAndPort);\n```\n\nSo getEndpoint must return a promise of an endpoint object with `.property()`. And `await endpoint.host()` etc. And `await cache_0.withHealthCheck(...)` can return anything.\n\nSo: withEndpoint/withBindMount/withEnvironment/waitFor → return `r` (sync, chainable). getEndpoint → Promise.resolve(endpointObj). withHealthCheck → Promise.resolve(r). addParameter/addContainer/... → return `r` sync.\n\nThat should execute the whole module. Let me fix.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Z.AI","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3eaf1e2a-824c-4c73-a5b7-15263968c283","uuid":"1448e921-c67e-4b62-9104-80b27870a55a","timestamp":"2026-09-01T13:26:15.744Z","request_id":"gen-1788269162-ikfBmi8mN3j8qBy0xrX5"}
